Name: auth_notreplicaonly
Type: SWITCH
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

If enabled, a user may not log in if ``replicaonly`` is set for the whole
server, or if the user is marked replica-only with ``cyr_deny -r``.  Logins
as an admin (including an admin identity reached by proxy authorization) and
anonymous logins are exempt.
